sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Cluster Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Operator as openshift-kueue-operator<br/>(2 replicas, system-cluster-critical)
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant Controller as kueue-controller-manager<br/>(1 replica)
    participant Webhook as Webhook Service<br/>443→9443/TLS
    participant Visibility as Visibility API<br/>443→8082
    participant Metrics as Metrics Service<br/>8443/TLS
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>ServiceMonitor

    Note over Admin, Prometheus: Flow 1: Operator Reconciliation
    Admin->>K8sAPI: Create Kueue CR<br/>(kueue.openshift.io/v1)
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Watch event<br/>SA: openshift-kueue-operator
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update CRDs<br/>(13 Kueue CRDs)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create RBAC<br/>(ClusterRoles, Bindings)
    Operator->>CertMgr: Create Certificate CR<br/>for webhook TLS
    CertMgr-->>K8sAPI: Provision kueue-webhook-server-cert<br/>Secret
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create kueue-controller-manager<br/>Deployment + Services

    Note over Admin, Prometheus: Flow 2: Webhook Admission (34 webhooks)
    Admin->>K8sAPI: Create Job/PyTorchJob/RayJob/etc.
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Mutating admission request<br/>TLS (cert-manager cert)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated resource<br/>(queue labels applied)
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Validating admission request<br/>TLS (cert-manager cert)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission response<br/>(policy enforced)

    Note over Admin, Prometheus: Flow 3: Queue Management
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch ClusterQueue, LocalQueue,<br/>Workload, ResourceFlavor CRs
    Controller->>K8sAPI: List Nodes<br/>(capacity-aware scheduling)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Node resource data
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update Workload status<br/>(admit/suspend/preempt)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Patch Job/Training Job<br/>(suspend/resume)

    Note over Admin, Prometheus: Flow 4: Observability
    Prometheus->>Metrics: Scrape /metrics<br/>8443/TLS
    Metrics-->>Prometheus: Metrics data<br/>TokenReview/SAR auth
    Admin->>Visibility: GET /pendingworkloads<br/>8082/HTTP
    Visibility-->>Admin: Pending workload list
